# .gitignore
# Skips files we don't want on GitHub - keeps it clean.
# Note: git does NOT support comments at the end of a pattern line, so each
# comment lives on its own line (an inline "# ..." would become part of the pattern).

# Installed dependencies (recreate them with `yarn install`)
node_modules/

# Log files
*.log

# Never commit your testnet key!
YOUR_TESTNET_PRIVATE_KEY

build/
